{"id":"53078","nombre":"Sopa de remolacha (borsch)","original":"Beetroot Soup (Borscht)","categoria":"Vegetarian","origen":"Ucrania","imagen":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/zadvgb1699012544.jpg","video":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6CXgPVw_-0g","enlace":"https://natashaskitchen.com/classic-russian-borscht-recipe/","etiquetas":["Sopa"],"ingredientes":[["Remolacha","3","Beetroot"],["Aceite de oliva","4 cdas","Olive Oil"],["Cubo de caldo de pollo","1","Chicken Stock Cube"],["Agua","6 tazas","Water"],["Papas","3","Potatoes"],["Porotos cannellini","1 lata","Cannellini Beans"],["Eneldo","Para decorar","Dill"]],"pasos":["Picar la remolacha, agregar agua y el cubo de caldo y cocinar 15 minutos. Agregar el resto de los ingredientes y hervir hasta que estén tiernos. Por último, agregar los porotos y cocinar 5 minutos. Servir en la misma olla."]}